name: Nine fixed scope boundaries halt at allowance and resume only after explicit revision
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME budget
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/large-scope-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 2 completed | stopped-work
expect: 25 parked
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-live-snap: 20 allowance exhausted | refused-resume
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART refused
ask: Does the maximum nine-boundary plan stop at two committed calls without consuming pending job attempts, adding work, or using protected Review capacity?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | original-allowance
keys: Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SCOPE CONTEXT | frozen-nine-contexts
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Boundary: integration | ninth-boundary
resize: 160x48
live-snap: scopes-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: scopes-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: scopes-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: scopes-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: scopes-40x12
expect: integration
ask: Can keyboard navigation reach the ninth boundary and its frozen context while retaining readable selection, paging and back controls at every size?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 APPROVED STUDY | allowance-back
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 25 parked | jobs-back
keys: Escape
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT partial | partial-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 partial acknowledged | partial-accepted
keys: Escape
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 2 committed / 4 calls | partial-report
expect: 2 protected review remaining
expect: 9 boundaries
ask: Does the partial report preserve per-boundary three-pass denominators, unstarted work and uncertain dollar cost without implying complete coverage or a fix?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/large-scope-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 25 parked | recovered-halt
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | recovered-allowance
keys: Down Down Down Down Enter
type: 29
keys: Enter L End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | revised-approval
expect: Total provider calls: 29
expect: Protected review calls: 2
expect: 27 fixed jobs
ask: Is the exact revised ceiling separately approved while the original 27 jobs and two committed calls remain unchanged?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved-revision
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 Plan approved | original-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | resumed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART progress-6
keys: r
live-snap: progress-6
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART progress-12
keys: r
live-snap: progress-12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART progress-18
keys: r
live-snap: progress-18
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART progress-24
keys: r
live-snap: progress-24
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART finished
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 27 completed | completed
keys: Escape
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT READY | completed-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 result selected | accepted-complete
keys: Escape
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 27 committed / 29 calls | complete-report
expect: 2 protected review remaining
ask: Does the completed report retain all nine independent denominators, exact spending and earlier partial acceptance without expanding the plan?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
